---
const books = [
  { id: 1, title: "Book 1", col: 1 },
  { id: 2, title: "Book 2", col: 2, parent: 1 },
  { id: 3, title: "Book 3", col: 3, parent: 2 },
  { id: 4, title: "Book 4", col: 2, parent: 1 },
];
---

<section class="books">
  <div class="books-container">
    <div class="book-info">
      <div class="book-info-img">
        <img src="/src/assets/book7-3d.png" alt="" />
      </div>
      <div class="book-info-content">
        <h2 class="title-section">A Parade Of Horribles</h2>
        <p class="text-info">
          It’s off to the races in the explosive 8th book in the Dungeon Crawler
          Carl series!
        </p>
        <p>
          As chaos and mass panic spread outside the dungeon in the wake of
          Faction Wars, Carl and Donut find themselves on the tenth floor, where
          they’re forced to compete in a surprisingly normal set of tasks. Well,
          normal for the dungeon. Races. Get from point A to point B, and don’t
          come in last. After each race, they pick an upgrade for their vehicle
          and the track gets more challenging. It all seems a little too normal,
          a little too simple.
        </p>
        <div class="links">
          <button class="btn-buy"
            >EBOOK
            <span class="btn-buy-corner"></span>
          </button>
          <button class="btn-buy">BOOK</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="books-list">
      <h2 class="title-section">BOOKS</h2>
      <div class="book-cards">
        <div class="book-item active">
          <div class="book-img">
            <img src="/src/assets/book.jpg" alt="" />
          </div>
          <div class="book-desc">
            <p>First Book, Floors 1-2</p>
            <h4>Dungeon Crawler Carl</h4>
          </div>
          <span class="border border-top-left"></span>
          <span class="border border-bottom-left"></span>
          <span class="border border-top-right"></span>
          <span class="border border-bottom-right"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="book-item active">
          <div class="book-img">
            <img src="/src/assets/book2.jpg" alt="" />
          </div>
          <div class="book-desc">
            <p>Second Book, Floor 3</p>
            <h4>Carl's Doomsday Scenario</h4>
          </div>
          <span class="border border-top-left"></span>
          <span class="border border-bottom-left"></span>
          <span class="border border-top-right"></span>
          <span class="border border-bottom-right"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="book-item active">
          <div class="book-img">
            <img src="/src/assets/book3.jpg" alt="" />
          </div>
          <div class="book-desc">
            <p>First Book, Floor 4</p>
            <h4>The Dungeon Anarchist's Cook Book</h4>
          </div>
          <span class="border border-top-left"></span>
          <span class="border border-bottom-left"></span>
          <span class="border border-top-right"></span>
          <span class="border border-bottom-right"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="book-item active">
          <div class="book-img">
            <img src="/src/assets/book4.jpg" alt="" />
          </div>
          <div class="book-desc">
            <p>First Book, Floor 5</p>
            <h4>The Gate Of The Feral Gods</h4>
          </div>
          <span class="border border-top-left"></span>
          <span class="border border-bottom-left"></span>
          <span class="border border-top-right"></span>
          <span class="border border-bottom-right"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <style>
    .books {
      position: relative;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .books::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 150px;
      background-image: url("src/assets/wave-top2.svg");
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-position: top;
      background-size: cover;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 10px rgb(1, 1, 1));
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .books::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 150px;
      background-image: url("src/assets/wave2.svg");
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-position: bottom;
      background-size: cover;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 10px rgb(1, 1, 1));
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .books-container {
      width: 1600px;
      height: 80vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    /* IZQUIERDA */
    .books-list {
      width: 600px;
      background: #26262656;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .book-cards {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    /* ITEMS */
    .book-item {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      height: 100px;
      /* background: #1c1c1c; */
      color: #eae0c2;
      cursor: pointer;
      width: 90%;
      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .book-img {
      width: 100px;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .book-img img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
    }

    .book-desc p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: #9b9582;
    }

    .book-desc h4 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .book-item:hover {
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }

    /* .book-item.active {
      border-left: 3px solid #facc15;
      background: #222;
    } */

    /* DERECHA */
    .book-info {
      position: relative;
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      height: 80%;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 12px;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .book-info-img {
      flex: 2;
      height: 90%;
    }

    .book-info-img img {
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: contain;
      opacity: 0.8;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 6px rgb(209, 204, 204));
    }

    .book-info-content {
      flex: 3;
      height: 90%;
      gap: 1rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: start;
    }

    .book-info-content p {
      font-family: "Inter", sans-serif;

      font-size: 1.08rem;
      line-height: 1.6;

      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);

      max-width: 65ch;

      text-wrap: pretty;
    }

    .book-info::after {
      position: absolute;
      content: "";
      inset: 0;
      background: #420f3c56;
      background-image: url("/src/assets/dots-50.png");
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-size: cover;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(79, 76, 76, 0.518);
      z-index: -1;
      /* filter: blur(5px); */
    }

    .book-info::before {
      position: absolute;
      content: "";
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url("/src/assets/Book-8-Ace-cover-scaled.png");
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-size: cover;
      z-index: -10;
      opacity: 0.1;
    }
  </style>
</section>
